#. Tag: title
#: importexport.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing and Exporting Foreign Formats"
msgstr "Importación e Exportación a Outros Formatos"

#. Tag: para
#: importexport.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kspread; has a limited ability to import (read) and export (write) "
"spreadsheet files with foreign formats. &kspread;'s capabilities at the time "
"of writing are summarized in the table below, for more up to date "
"information visit <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/filters/status.phtml"
"\"> http://www.koffice.org/filters/status.phtml</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&kspread; ten faculdades limitadas para importar (ler) e exportar (escreber) "
"ficheiros de folla de cálculo alleos. As capacidades de &kspread; na hora de "
"elaborar esta documentación resúmense na táboa en baixo, para información "
"mais detallada visite <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/filters/status."
"phtml\">http://www.koffice.org/filters/status.phtml</ulink>."

